Between nodes **7.6%** — inside the 8% tolerance. **Not resolvable**: a node's own mean moves 12.6% between repetitions, wider than the 8% tolerance and more than the gap between nodes.

**Not resolvable at this sample size**: one replica varies 21.7% against *itself* between repetitions, wider than the 8% tolerance and more than the 17.2% between replicas. Lengthen the probe or add repetitions rather than acting on it.

